 *      (no view check; a trained spot's "ammoBox" says where the ammo
 *      counter is), then {"op":"go"}: hands off, the Core holds aim and
 *      fire, watches the HUD's ammo counter, lets go about a second after it
 *      stops (empty) or when the reload brings the full magazine back, and
 *      reports the rate from the counter and the magazine size ("30-round
 *      mag · 600 RPM (measured)"). A counter it cannot read falls back to
 *      the muzzle flashes, said as a guess. D416 (the owner, 2026-10-20):
 *      it RELOADS first (the config's reload button, Square / X by default:
 *      reloadOf) and waits for the full magazine before it fires; and the
 *      player's controller, mouse and keyboard are paused for the whole run
 *      (touching them no longer stops it): Stop, closing the Lab or the app
 *      going quiet (its poll is the lease) gives them back at once.
 *   B. THE WALL (recoil-wall.js): the player fires; the Core only watches.
 *
